===persian===

به خاکِ غمَت نشانده‌ام...
با هزار ریشه... سبز شدم...
برگم بی‌سایه شد،
تا خورشید را از خاک نگیرد...
و... هیچ روییده‌ای...
در خاک نمیرد.
۱۳۷۲/۶/۲۶

===machine===

Planted in the soil of your sorrow...
with a thousand roots... I came up green...
My leaf turned shadowless,
so as not to take the sun from the earth...
and so... that nothing which has grown...
should die in the soil.
1372/6/26

===lantern===

Planted in the soil of your sorrow,
with a thousand roots I came up green.
My leaf turned shadowless
so as not to take the sun from the earth,
so that nothing which has grown
should die in the soil.

1372/6/26

===translation===

===footnotes===

The leaf gives up its own shadow so that nothing underneath it goes without light — a plant
that refuses the one advantage of being tall.
